# image editors leave these beside the file they overwrote
*~

# Recording masters. The site ships a re-encoded webm/mp4 pair beside each of
# these — door-hinge is 250KB + 323KB against a 1.4MB master — and a repo
# served by GitHub Pages carries its history forever. Keep the masters with the
# release they belong to, re-encode from them, and commit only the small files.
tools/pivot/media/*.gif
tools/pivot/media/*-master.mp4
